---
id: org.dxos.example.launch-video
name: Launch video
version: 0.1.0
extends:
  - org.dxos.spec.video
---

A 45-second launch video for Composer, written in the video dialect.

## Extensions

| Term        | URI                          |
| ----------- | ---------------------------- |
| `asset`     | `org.dxos.mdl.asset@0.1`     |
| `caption`   | `org.dxos.mdl.caption@0.1`   |
| `character` | `org.dxos.mdl.character@0.1` |
| `scene`     | `org.dxos.mdl.scene@0.1`     |
| `screening` | `org.dxos.mdl.screening@0.1` |
| `shot`      | `org.dxos.mdl.shot@0.1`      |
| `voiceover` | `org.dxos.mdl.voiceover@0.1` |

## Cast and assets

```mdl
character maya: Maya, a product designer
```

```mdl
character sam: Sam, Maya's teammate
```

```mdl
character narrator: The narrator
  voice: warm, unhurried, never salesy
```

```mdl
asset logo: Composer logo
  source: brand kit, animated SVG
```

```mdl
asset screen-capture: Screen capture of the app
  source: recorded with autocue against a seeded space
```

```mdl
asset theme: Theme track
  source: licensed library track, 60 s cut
```

## Script

```mdl
scene SC-1: Cold open
  duration: 8s
  goal: The viewer sees their work scattered across five apps.
  cast: [maya]
```

```mdl
shot SH-1: Tabs pile up
  scene: SC-1
  camera: over Maya's shoulder, slow push in
  action: Browser tabs multiply until they fill her screen.
  assets: [theme]
```

```mdl
scene SC-2: One space
  duration: 15s
  goal: The viewer sees the same work in one Composer space.
  follows: SC-1
  cast: [maya, narrator]
```

```mdl
shot SH-2: Tabs collapse into a space
  scene: SC-2
  camera: match cut from SH-1, then pull back
  action: The tabs fold into one Composer window.
  assets: [screen-capture, theme]
```

```mdl
shot SH-3: A document, a board and a chat side by side
  scene: SC-2
  camera: screen capture, slow pan
  action: Maya drags a task from the chat onto the board.
  assets: [screen-capture]
```

```mdl
voiceover VO-1: Composer keeps your work together, and keeps it yours.
  scene: SC-2
  at: 3s
  by: narrator
  over: [SH-2, SH-3]
```

```mdl
caption CA-1: Local-first. Yours.
  scene: SC-2
  at: 9s
  transcribes: VO-1
```

```mdl
scene SC-3: Together
  duration: 14s
  goal: The viewer sees two people edit one space at once.
  follows: SC-2
  cast: [maya, sam, narrator]
```

```mdl
shot SH-4: Split screen
  scene: SC-3
  camera: two screens side by side
  action: Sam's cursor appears in Maya's document and they finish a sentence together.
  assets: [screen-capture]
```

```mdl
voiceover VO-2: Invite anyone. Work at the same time, even offline.
  scene: SC-3
  at: 2s
  by: narrator
  over: [SH-4]
```

```mdl
scene SC-4: Close
  duration: 8s
  goal: The viewer knows where to get it.
  follows: SC-3
  cast: [narrator]
```

```mdl
shot SH-5: Logo on black
  scene: SC-4
  camera: centred title card
  action: The logo draws itself in.
  assets: [logo, theme]
```

```mdl
voiceover VO-3: Composer. Get it at composer.space.
  scene: SC-4
  at: 1s
  by: narrator
  over: [SH-5]
```

```mdl
caption CA-2: composer.space
  scene: SC-4
  at: 2s
  transcribes: VO-3
```

## Screenings

```mdl
screening SN-1: First cut, internal
  covers: [SC-1, SC-2, SC-3]
  audience: five people who have not used Composer
  expect: Each can say in one sentence what the app replaces.
```

```mdl
screening SN-2: Final cut, launch partners
  covers: [SC-1, SC-2, SC-3, SC-4]
  audience: launch partners
  expect: Each can name where to get it.
```
